      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This “Synagogue Consecration Prayer ” by the Hon. Lily H. Montagu (1873-1963) was included by Rabbi Morrison David Bial in his anthology, <tei:hi rend="italic">An Offering of Prayer</tei:hi> (1962), p. 50. Although the context is not provided by Rabbi Bial, we would like to imagine that the consecration was for the establishment of the West Central Liberal Jewish Synagogue in 1928 (destroyed by Nazi German bombardment of London in 1941). If you know for certain the context of this prayer, please leave a comment or contact us.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_46336_notes"/>
